<h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">Funding eligibility result</h1>

<p class="govuk-body">You've already been allocated scholarship funding for <%= course.localise_sentence_embedded_course_name %> course with <%= lead_provider %>.</p>

<p class="govuk-body">If you need to change something about your course or provider, email continuing-professional-development@digital.education.gov.uk.</p>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-m">If you're taking the course again</h2>

<p class="govuk-body">Continue to register.</p>

<p class="govuk-body">You would need to pay for the course another way if you were previously funded but you did not pass or withdrew from the course. For example you could pay for the course fees yourself or ask your workplace or trust to:</p>

<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
  <li>cover the full cost of the course</li>
  <li>share the cost of the course with you</li>
</ul>
